            <ArticleTitle>Weighting the Parameters, a Response to Bancel׳s &quot;Searching for Global Consciousness: A Seventeen Year Exploration&quot;.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>102-105</MedlinePgn>
